WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.310
What is (x + 2)(x + 3)?

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.750
Draw a rectangle with those sides.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.370
Split it into four boxes.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.270
x², 3x, 2x and 6

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.730
Add them up.

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:21.013
x² + 5x + 6
